eaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">诺奖得主John Jumper辞任Google DeepMind职务并正式加入Anthropic</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/46b262aa373f6af53201f715274722dd.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月20日，2024年诺贝尔化学奖得主、AlphaFold核心开发者John Jumper正式宣布辞去Google DeepMind职务，转投Anthropic。Jumper在DeepMind效力九年，与Demis Hassabis共同推动了蛋白质结构预测领域的科研范式变革。此次变动正值Google DeepMind核心人才流失期，此前Gemini联合负责人Noam Shazeer亦离职加入OpenAI。行业分析认为，Anthropic近期通过收购Coefficient Bio及推出Claude for Life Sciences等举措，正深耕生命科学赛道，旨在将药物研发周期压缩10倍。Jumper的加入是Anthropic在该高精尖领域的关键战略布局。随着顶级科研人才在OpenAI、Google DeepMi</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果与LM Studio合作实现四台Mac Studio运行万亿参数Kimi K2.6模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e46295a4cd804d1e594ef08c49201e40.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果与LM Studio在WWDC期间展示了通过四台搭载M3 Ultra芯片的Mac Studio集群，成功运行月之暗面旗下万亿参数模型Kimi K2.6的成果。该模型采用MoE架构，推理时激活约320亿参数，但完整权重加载需约2TB内存。通过macOS的RDMA-over-Thunderbolt技术，四台设备通过Thunderbolt 5接口互联，将统一内存整合为逻辑超大内存池，实现每秒约28个token的生成速度。此外，LM Studio发布了基于Tailscale Mesh VPN的LM Link组件，支持用户通过加密通道远程调用本地集群算力，确保数据本地闭环。此方案利用Apple Silicon统一内存架构，为企业提供了一种替代昂贵云端GPU集群的本地部署新路径，显著降低了长周期运营的硬件成本，并推动了</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软拟在 Copilot Cowork 中引入 DeepSeek V4 模型以优化成本</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6cac54587de973a64b1801adb05b2d26.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软正计划将中国 DeepSeek V4 模型纳入其企业级 AI Agent 系统 Copilot Cowork 的模型选项列表，旨在应对高昂的算力成本压力。Copilot Cowork 目前已在全球商用，超半数财富 500 强企业已完成部署。为应对模型频繁调用带来的成本挑战，微软正重构商业模式，在固定订阅制基础上新增按量计费的弹性机制。同时，微软正推动模型分层路由机制，根据任务需求智能调度模型，以实现运营成本的精细化管理。若此次合作落地，将成为美国大型科技公司首次在核心企业级 AI 产品中引入中国大模型，标志着行业在应对 AI 应用“烧钱”困局时，正通过更开放、灵活的模型策略寻求生存与增长路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信灰度上线原生AI助手小微，支持语音文字操控应用功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f8f5553f2aa26006ba2d5541f429271d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯微信近日低调开启原生AI助手“小微”的限量灰度测试。部分受邀用户可在微信主界面左上角点击“小微”图标，进入AI交互窗口。该助手支持用户通过文字或语音指令直接调用微信原生功能，包括发送消息、查询朋友圈及预约小程序服务等。与以往第三方接入的AI工具不同，“小微”具备系统级权限与更高的生态融合度，能够直接解构并执行复杂指令。腾讯客服确认该功能为微信团队内部测试的原生AI服务。此次上线标志着微信正从即时通讯平台向智能助手入口转型，通过大模型深度整合，重塑十亿级用户的交互习惯。目前该功能处于早期测试阶段，后续将根据算法与算力优化情况逐步扩大内测范围，为移动互联网生态的AI工程化落地提供重要参考。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米正式发布并开源全屋智能AI方案Xiaomi Miloco 2.0</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f483c15c69bd60eef8497f9703d661f5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小米正式发布并开源全屋智能AI方案Xiaomi Miloco 2.0，该方案基于自研MiMo大模型构建，通过Agent形式接入OpenClaw框架，实现从规则触发向自主推理的跨越。Miloco 2.0具备通用常识、身份识别、家庭记忆与家庭任务四大核心能力，支持识别家庭成员及体态，并能根据长期习惯主动决策执行复杂任务。部署方面，系统要求内存不低于4GB、存储不低于256GB，推荐运行于Mac mini（macOS或Linux系统），Windows用户需通过WSL环境运行。用户需准备小米账号、米家设备及MiMo-v2.5系列模型API Key。该方案通过Web家庭面板提供实时概览与日志管理，标志着全屋智能迈向主动服务阶段，代码已在GitHub完整开源，为开发者提供构建家庭智能体的底层架构支持。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
